        "si_used": true,
        "procedure": "General SI procedure: Zn(ClO4)2·6H2O (1.0 mmol), Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.226 g, 0.5 mmol) and NaO2CCHMe2 (1.0 mmol) were dissolved in an 80:20 mixture of CH2Cl2 and methanol (20 cm3). LH (0.10 cm3, 1.0 mmol) was added and after stirring for 5 minutes NaOMe (0.108 g, 2.0 mmol) was added and the mixture stirred for a further 20 minutes. The solution was evaporated to dryness and re-dissolved in CH2Cl2 (15 cm3) before being filtered to remove NaNO3 and NaClO4. Methanol (5 cm3) was added to the filtrate and stirred. Vapour diffusion of diethyl ether yielded crystals after approximately 3 days.",
